{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "522807c6-6452-87ec-a8c7-b90a2ad14d01",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T12:25:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about a pothole on my street. Actually it's the same pothole, the cold patch they put in last week washed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "264 Marsh Street, in the Point. Right out front of the house, by the curb on the street side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marsh Street, got it. And you said it was patched last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last Thursday, I believe. A crew came and put the cold patch in. Then we had that snow-to-rain storm that ended Monday, three days ago, and it's all gone. The patch is out and the hole is back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens a lot with cold patch, unfortunately, especially with rain right on top of snow. How big is the hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's wider than before, I'd say a foot and a half across. And it's full of water, so you can't see how deep it is. A car comes down the street, they don't see it until they're in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's the danger of those. Has anybody hit it that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've seen. I'm only reporting it. I've been awake since five this morning and I can tell it, so forgive me if I repeat myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. I've got all of it. Let me just read the location back. 264 Marsh Street, pothole in the roadway in front of the house, previous cold patch washed out, filled with water. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Well, one small thing. It's not in front of the house exactly, it's slightly toward the corner, maybe two houses down from the corner. But the number is 264, that's the nearest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, toward the corner side of 264. I'll put that in the notes so the crew finds it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And how long does it usually take for them to come back and fix it? Is it days, or weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the weather and how many are on the list. After a storm the crews are covering a lot of streets. Usually it's a matter of days once it's logged, but a wet week can stretch that. A proper permanent repair waits for warmer, drier weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the cold patch is just temporary, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it's a stopgap in the winter. They'll likely go back with another patch and then do it right in the spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I just want it noted that it's the second time it's been reported, so it's the same spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it as a repeat at the same location. Do you want a call back when it's done, or are you fine just watching for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back is fine. My number is 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven four, got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dulce Rocha. D-U-L-C-E, R-O-C-H-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Rocha. Everything's in. If it gets worse, or somebody damages a car on it, call us right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Get some rest, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T12:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
